ocumentation/project-operations/reporting-bugs":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reporting bugs is a great way for anyone to help improve Swift. The open source Swift project uses GitHub Issues for tracking bugs."}],"url":"\/documentation\/project-operations\/reporting-bugs","type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Reporting Bugs","identifier":"doc:\/\/project-operations\/documentation\/project-operations\/reporting-bugs"},"doc://project-operations/documentation/project-operations/contributor-ladder":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/project-operations\/contributor-ladder","title":"Contributor Ladder","identifier":"doc:\/\/project-operations\/documentation\/project-operations\/contributor-ladder","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This contributor ladder defines the roles you might gain while contributing to Swift on GitHub. Each role has privileges associated, which requires building trust with the community of contributors. We recognize there are many different types of contributors to Swift and we appreciate every single one! Everyone who has participated in the open source Swift project is a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Contributor"}]},{"type":"text","text":": This can be by writing code, answering questions on the forums, reporting or triaging bugs, or participating in the Swift evolution process."}],"kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://project-operations/documentation/project-operations/contributing-to-swift":{"role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/project-operations\/contributing-to-swift","title":"Contributing to Swift","identifier":"doc:\/\/project-operations\/documentation\/project-operations\/contributing-to-swift","abstract":[{"text":"The Swift.org community has the singular goal of making the world’s best general purpose programming language. Collectively we will develop the language in the open, with contributions from anyone who wishes to participate. This guideline document describes how the Swift community is organized so that we can work together to add amazing new capabilities to Swift, and make it available to even more developers across more platforms.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","type":"topic"}}}